  "body": "Once a user has paired a site with a device, the current spec allows the site to completely enumerate the Services, Characteristics, and Descriptors defined by the device. We could instead require the site to explicitly list all the Services it expects to interact with, and then invent some UI (but what?) to warn the user what abilities the site will have. Should we?\n",
